      "sourceTextSha256": "572fe7c3e55d66f3b77412d0f75d5f7f1f9d6d08fa96417458e34d86790db7e0",
      "text": "Day 13 · Full-day excursion to Viña Vik, in the Millahue Valley of the Cachapoal region, about two hours from Santiago: one of the most celebrated wineries in South America, whose titanium, sail-shaped roof blends into the hills among the vineyards. A tour explaining the wine-making process, a tasting of premium Vik wines and lunch at the restaurant overlooking the valley.\n\nAccommodation: Mandarin Oriental Santiago, Club Room, breakfast",
